<title>SINGAPORE: Nobel Design 1996 net profit up 25.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Nobel Design 1996 net profit up 25.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996 (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  2.63   vs    2.10</p>
<p>    Final dividend (percent)	8.0    vs    8.0</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		 3.22   vs    2.62</p>
<p>    Turnover			   38.38   vs   29.60</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest   0.28   vs    0.10</p>
<p>    Interest expense		  0.25   vs    0.16</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax profit	4.04   vs    3.40</p>
<p>    Associates	     (loss)   0.04   vs    0.03 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax				   1.05   vs    1.02</p>
<p>    Minorities	     (loss)   0.32   vs    0.24 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Nobel Design Holdings Ltd is involved in interior design, furnishings and furniture-making.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
